ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a university laboratory, the research team is studying plant growth. Researcher Xiao Lin says to the lab assistant Xiao Ma, \"We plant 80 plants, most of them are roses, some are sunflowers, but a very small part are tulips.\" After careful observation, Xiao finds that there are 30 sunflowers.\n\n[Question]\nHow many roses does Xiao Ma estimate are planted before observing?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before observing, Xiao Ma estimates that 60 roses are planted.\nB. Before observing, Xiao Ma estimates that 45 roses are planted.\nC. Before observing, Xiao Ma estimates that 30 roses are planted.\nD. Before observing, Xiao Ma estimates that 80 roses are planted.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":5,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004609571632403394,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af66e9ef4429d1fd72f6b7c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794535070918,"createTime":"2026-11-13 09:57:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"e9d26242ea534b589fec2a2c8e88afc8"}